1          /* SAS program to accompany the article
2             "Discrimination, accuracy, and stability in binary classifiers"
                                                           The SAS System

3             by Rick Wicklin, published 08MAY2019 on The DO Loop blog:
4             https://blogs.sas.com/content/iml/2019/05/08/stability-binary-classifier.html
5          
6             This analyses illustrates many of the ideas in
7             D. Ling, "Measuring Model Stability", Proceedings of the SAS Global Forum 2019 Conference,
8             and presented at the conference.
9             https://www.sas.com/content/dam/SAS/support/en/sas-global-forum-proceedings/2019/3568-2019.pdf
10         */
11         
