3             by Rick Wicklin, published 11NOV2019 on The DO Loop blog:
4             https://blogs.sas.com/content/iml/2019/11/11/round-to-even.html
5          
6             This program shows how to use the round-half-to-even method in SAS.
7             Data from the documentation for PROC UNIVARIATE
8             "Creating a One-Way Comparative Histogram"
9             https://bit.ly/36Byroe
10         
11            "The effective channel length (in microns) is measured for 1225 field effect
12             transistors."  This data uses only the subset where Lot = 'Lot 1'
13         */
14         
15         /* Create a step plot of the round-half-to-even function */
16         data Series;
17         do x = 0 to 6 by 0.05;
18            y = rounde(x);
19            group = y;
20            output;
21         end;
