7        ! may be equally appropriate Deaths occurring outside the time window for this table should be listed elsewhere.
8          
9          This table should be provided by the sponsor in electronic format. The exact design of the table and the preferred
9        ! electronic format should be established in discussions between the sponsor and the reviewing division.
10         
11         Similar lists should be provided for patients exposed to placebo and active control drugs.
12         
13         This is the data lock date for entering data into this table (i.e., the date beyond which additional exposed patients
13       ! were not available for entry). Generally this date should be no more than several months prior to the submission date for
13       !  an NDA. This date as well as this table may likely need to be updated during the course of NDA review as more data
13       ! become available.
