3          /*                                                                          */
4          /*          DESCRIPTION: Find subject counts per arm for each disposition   */
5          /*                        event appearing in the study, for all subjects    */
6          /*                        and for exposed subjects                          */
7          /*                       Create charts of the time to disposition event	for */
8          /*                        all subjects and for exposed subjects             */
9          /*                       Creates an Excel spreadsheet as output             */
10         /*                                                                          */
11         /*      EVALUATION TYPE:                                                    */
12         /*                                                                          */
13         /*               AUTHOR: Andreas Anastassopoulos                            */
14         /*                          (andreas.anastassapoulos@us.ibm.com)            */
15         /*                                                                          */
16         /*                 DATE: December 9, 2009                                   */
17         /*                                                                          */
18         /*  EXTERNAL FILES USED: Disposition_Template.xls -- Excel template         */
19         /*                       data_checks.sas -- Generic variable checks         */
20         /*                       data_checks_disposition.sas -- DS data checks      */
21         /*                       sl_gs_output.sas -- Script Launcher settings output*/
22         /*                       err_output.sas -- Error output when missing vars   */
23         /*                                                                          */
24         /*  PARAMETERS REQUIRED: saspath -- location of external panel SAS programs */
25         /*                       utilpath -- location of external util SAS programs */
26         /*                       ndabla -- NDA or BLA number                        */
27         /*                       studyid -- study number                            */
28         /*                                                                          */
29         /*           LOCAL ONLY: studypath -- location of the drug study datasets   */
30         /*                       outpath -- location of the output                  */
31         /*                       outfile -- filename of the output                  */
32         /*                       templatepath -- location of the Excel template     */
33         /*                       template -- filename of the template               */
34         /*                                                                          */
35         /*   VARIABLES REQUIRED: DM -- ACTARM or ARM                                */
36         /*                             USUBJID                                      */
37         /*                             RFSTDTC if no DSSTDY                         */
38         /*                       DS -- DSDECOD                                      */
39         /*                             DSSTDY or DSSTDTC                            */
40         /*                             USUBJID                                      */
41         /*                       EX -- USUBJID                                      */
42         /*                                                                          */
43         /* OTHER VARIABLES USED: DM -- ARMCD                                        */
44         /* IF AVAILABLE          DS -- DSCAT                                        */
45         /*                             DSSCAT                                       */
46         /*                             DSSEQ                                        */
47         /*                                                                          */
