66                        Added handling for missing study day/date variables
67                        Number of DSDECOD terms now stored in separate macro variables for all vs ex
68         
69         2011-03-27 DK  Added run location handling
70         
71         2011-04-24 DK  Fixed an error in determining the number of randomized subjects
72                        when DSCAT and DSSCAT are missing; now determined by looking at DM_DS/DM_DS_EX
73         
74         2011-05-08 DK  Error/no subjects in DM handling
75         
76         2011-05-10 DK  Fixed substr to extract dates, order of sort variables, arm name length,
77                        by_ds2_one datastep where statement to prevent using missing values in a do loop
78         
79         2011-05-18 DK  Changed sort in %ds_by_arm to by dsdy instead of dsstdtc/dsstdy
