50                M_LB:     Libname containing ADaM data, such as ADVS.
51                          WORK by default, since step (2) creates the desired WORK subset.
52                M_DS:     Measuments data set including derived Change-from-baseline, such as ADVS.
53                T_VAR:   Variable in M_DS with the Treatment Name, such as TRTP, TRTA.
54                TN_VAR:  Variable in M_DS with the Treatment Number (display controls order), such as TRTPN, TRTAN.
