55                C_VAR:   Variable in M_DS with change-from-baseline data, such as CHG.
56                B_VAR:    (Leave blank to omit p-value from summary table.) Variable in M_DS with baseline measurements
57                REF_TRTN: (Leave blank to omit p-value from summary table.) Numeric value of TN_VAR for reference (comparator)
57       ! treatment
58                B_VISN:   Visit number that represents Baseline in AVISITN (e.g., 0)
59                E_VISN:   Visit number that represents endpoint in AVISITN for chg-from-baseline comparison (e.g., 99)
60                P_FL:     Population flag variable. 'Y' indicates record is in population of interest.
61                A_FL:     Analysis Flag variable.   'Y' indicates that record is selected for analysis.
