8              Sample Output:
8        ! https://github.com/phuse-org/phuse-scripts/blob/master/whitepapers/WPCT/outputs_sas/WPCT-F.07.03_Box_plot_DIABP_with_chan
8        ! ge_by_visit_for_timepoint_815.pdf
9              Using this program:
10               * Figure 7.3 combines analyses from Figures 7.1 and 7.2 as side-by-side graphics on a PDF page.
11               * See USER PROCESSING AND SETTINGS, below, to configure this program for your environment and data
12               * Program will plot all visits, ordered by AVISITN, with maximum of 20 boxes on a page (default)
13                 + see user option MAX_BOXES_PER_PAGE, below, to change limit of 20 boxes per page
14               * Program separately plots all parameters provided in PARAMCD
15               * Measurements within each PARAMCD and ATPTN determine precision of statistical results
16                 + MEAN gets 1 extra decimal, STD DEV gets 2 extra decimals
17                 + see macro UTIL_VALUE_FORMAT to modify this behavior
18               * If your treatment names are too long for the summary table, abbreviate them
19                 in the input data, and add a footnote that explains your short Tx codes
20                 + This program contains custom code to shorted Tx labels in the PhUSE CS test data
21                 + See "2b) USER SUBSET of data", below
