26               * The footnote could dynamically describe any normal range lines that appear. See the Fig. 7.1 specifications.
27               * For annotated RED CIRCLEs outside normal range limits
28                   UPDATE the test data so that default outputs have some IQR OUTLIER SQUAREs that are not also RED.
29               * LABS & ECG - ADaM VS/LAB/ECG domains have some different variables and variable naming conventions.
30                   - What variables are used for LAB/ECG box plots?
