31                   UPDATE the test data so that default outputs have some IQR OUTLIER SQUAREs that are not also RED.
32               * The footnote could dynamically describe any normal range lines that appear. See the Fig. 7.1 specifications.
33               * LABS & ECG - ADaM VS/LAB/ECG domains have some different variables and variable naming conventions.
34                   - What variables are used for LAB/ECG box plots?
35                   - What visits/time-points are relevant to LAB/ECG box plots?
36                   - Handle all of these within one template program?
37                     Or separate them (and accept some redundancy)?
38                   - NB: Currently vars like AVISIT, AVISITN, ATPT, ATPTN are hard-coded in this program
39         
40         end HEADER ***/
41         
