98         
99         /*******************************************************/
100        /*here we are creating the qx of our table. We must be sure that it loops around the years column*/
101        /*if you change the years to include some groups over the age of 75, increase the do loop*/
102        
103        * 2. Check to see if all the tables are here;
104        Proc Freq Data=tests;
105           Tables sexRace/Nocol Norow Nopercent Nocum;
106        Title 'check to see if there are 12 sexRace groups';
107        Run;

NOTE: There were 51 observations read from the data set WORK.TESTS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE FREQ printed page 1.
